  "title": "Chand Bibi",
  "summary": "Chand Bibi (Chand Sultana) was a princess of Ahmadnagar who married into the Bijapur ruling house and later returned to Ahmadnagar. She is remembered for leading the fort's defence against Mughal forces under Prince Murad, which sources place from 1595, and she died in 1599. Ahmadnagar fell to the Mughals in 1600.",
